    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing, i don't want to just survive it. surviving feels like just being a machine that produces money for everyone else while i slowly burn out. there isn't some magical moment where the math actually works in my favor. it just feels like a loop designed to keep me trapped. does it ever actually stop being this way?",
